<title>FINLAND: HELSINKI OTC AND BROKERS LIST TRADE STARTED - BOURSE.</title>
<headline>HELSINKI OTC AND BROKERS LIST TRADE STARTED - BOURSE.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade on the supplementary Brokers and the OTC lists started at 1240/0940 GMT on Monday after a technical problem delayed the opening, the Helsinki Stock Exchange said in a statement.</p>
<p>Trade on the main list started earlier, at 1050/0750 GMT, 20 minutes late.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-6805 0245</p>
